10:- Priority order if short: billing (§3) → access control (§6) → payments (§4) → webhook (§5) → UI (§9).
40:| R26 | Allocation on approval: lease invoices with something unpaid, order due date, deposit before rent, period index; fill each fully, including not-yet-due; leftover → payments.unapplied_sen (only online can have it) | payments |
44:| R30 | Pay now (tenant): API creates a gateway bill for the amount due now = unpaid amounts of the lease's invoices due on or before today's MYT date; nothing due → refuse; bill ids impossible to guess | webhook |
45:| R31 | Show bill id + amount; only the webhook settles a bill; /payments/return?bill_id=…&paid=true only shows the DB status and changes nothing | webhook/UI |
46:| R32 | Webhook POST /api/webhooks/gateway, x-www-form-urlencoded fields id, paid, paid_amount, paid_at, transaction_id, transaction_status, x_signature; "may add more fields in future" | webhook |
47:| R33 | Signature: all fields except x_signature, sorted by key (char code), key+value, joined "\|", HMAC-SHA256 with GATEWAY_X_SIGNATURE_KEY, lowercase hex; test vector in brief | webhook |
48:| R34 | Webhook table: bad/missing sig 401; unknown bill 404; paid=true & paid_amount ≠ bill amount 422; paid=true & bill pending/failed → 200, bill paid + one approved online payment received_at = paid_at, allocated; paid=true & already paid 200 none; paid=false & pending 200 → failed; paid=false & failed 200 none; paid=false & paid 200 none ("a paid bill never goes back") | webhook |
49:| R35 | Retries incl. same moment; "A bill creates at most one payment, ever."; "Never log the secret key or whole callback payloads." | webhook/concurrency |
73:- Interface the graders call: **the brief names it** — REST route handlers (§7), `src/lib/billing.ts` imported directly (§3), PostgREST + Storage with the publishable key + user JWTs (§6), the webhook (§5). Server actions are ours (UI only) and call the same services.
92:  | POST /api/leases/:leaseId/gateway-bills | the lease's tenant | 201 `{ billId, amountSen }` | 422 nothing due |
94:  | POST /api/webhooks/gateway | the gateway | see R34 | |
104:    payments: { id; amountSen; unappliedSen; method: 'cash'|'bank_transfer'|'online'; status: 'pending_verification'|'approved'|'rejected'|'voided'; receivedAt: string }[] }
107:- Webhook form fields: `id, paid, paid_amount, paid_at ("2026-04-01 00:30:12 +0800"), transaction_id, transaction_status (completed|failed|pending), x_signature`; test vector key `test_x_signature_key` → `06994fab2d674e7829144eaa2204631716d3c099b503d38945e92b6296531641`.
109:- Tables / required columns (R48): organizations(id, name) · memberships(user_id, org_id, role) · units(id, org_id, name) · tenants(id, org_id, user_id, full_name, email, phone) · leases(id, org_id, unit_id, tenant_id, start_date, end_date, monthly_rent_sen, deposit_sen) · invoices(id, org_id, lease_id, kind, period_index, period_start, period_end, due_date, amount_sen) · payments(id, or
117:  | leases, invoices, payments, payment_allocations, gateway_bills | none | read rows of own leases | read own org | read own org |
120:- Env vars (submission list): `NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL, NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY, SUPABASE_SECRET_KEY, DATABASE_URL, DIRECT_URL, GATEWAY_X_SIGNATURE_KEY` (+ ours: `TEST_BASE_URL`, `SEED_PASSWORD`). Env file the graders use: `.env.local` (copied from .env.example).
128:- 400: malformed JSON, unknown keys (zod `.strict()`), bad types, invalid dates, invalid range. 409: overlap (23P01), not pending / not approved, idempotency key reused with a different payload. 422: over cap / over remaining balance / nothing due / webhook amount mismatch. 500: generic `{ "error": "Internal error" }`, no SQL, no stack.
132:- Money: bigint sen in SQL (brief R48), `number` in TS; Prisma BigInt converted to number in ONE helper (`toSen`) that throws if not a safe integer; never floats. Single currency MYR: `currency char(3) not null default 'MYR' check (currency = 'MYR')` on leases/invoices/payments/gateway_bills (kit rule). Rejected: no currency column (kit asks for a CHECK when one currency).
138:- Payments: partial allowed; manual over cap → 422 (brief R22); online payments are never refused once captured — leftover → unapplied_sen (brief R26). Allocation order brief R26.
140:- Void (R24): deletes that payment's allocation rows, sets status voided, keeps the payment row; unapplied_sen of OTHER payments is not re-applied (brief: "Other payments' allocations do not change") — see Q3.
141:- Payments are never deleted (R25): a `private` trigger blocks DELETE and allows UPDATE only for the transitions pending_verification→approved/rejected, approved→voided (plus unapplied_sen/allocation bookkeeping inside the private functions); amount, method, received_at, lease, org are immutable. Rejected: kit's "refunds/voids are new rows" (the brief changes status on the same row).
144:- Concurrency (R28/R35/R46): every money write locks the **lease row** `FOR UPDATE` first (cap and allocation are lease-wide), then the payment / bill row; webhook locks the bill row first then the lease (always bill → lease order; other paths never lock bills). Lease overlap: `EXCLUDE USING gist (unit_id WITH =, daterange(start_date, end_date, '[]') WITH &&)` (btree_gist). One payment per b
145:- Money writes live in plpgsql functions in schema `private` called by server code via Prisma `$queryRaw` (owner role): `private.record_payment`, `private.approve_payment`, `private.reject_payment`, `private.void_payment`, `private.allocate_payment` (internal), `private.create_gateway_bill`, `private.apply_gateway_callback`. Lease creation = Prisma interactive transaction (lease + createMany(i
146:- Idempotency for manual payments: brief's body has no key → optional `Idempotency-Key` header (uuid); when present, UNIQUE (org_id, idempotency_key): same payload → original `{id,status}` 200, different payload → 409. Never required (see Q1). Webhook idempotency = bill state machine under `FOR UPDATE` + unique gateway_bill_id (no 5-minute replay window: brief has no timestamp field and 
147:- Webhook parsing: raw body `await req.text()` → `URLSearchParams`; duplicate keys → 400; signature over all fields except x_signature (extra fields included, R32); `timingSafeEqual` on equal-length hex buffers; 401 before anything else. Bill id that is not a uuid → 404. paid_at must match `YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM:SS ±HHMM` → converted to timestamptz; paid_amount must be `^\d+$`. Logged: bil
148:- Bill ids: `gen_random_uuid()` (122 random bits). Amount due now computed in SQL under the lease lock with p_as_of; several pending bills allowed (a second paid one lands as unapplied).
152:- audit_log: append-only by triggers (`BEFORE UPDATE OR DELETE` row trigger + `BEFORE TRUNCATE` statement trigger raising) — applies to service_role and owner (R43). Actions: `lease.created, payment.recorded, payment.approved, payment.rejected, payment.voided, gateway_bill.created, gateway_bill.paid, gateway_bill.failed`.
164:| leases, invoices, payments, payment_allocations, gateway_bills | select | select | select rows of own leases |
181:- `gateway_bills(id, org_id, lease_id, amount_sen bigint > 0, status text not null default 'pending' check in ('pending','paid','failed'), currency MYR, created_by uuid null, transaction_id text null, transaction_status text null, paid_at timestamptz null, updated_at timestamptz; (org_id, lease_id) → leases RESTRICT; unique (org_id, id)`
182:- `payments(id, org_id, lease_id, amount_sen bigint > 0, unapplied_sen bigint not null default 0 check 0 <= unapplied_sen <= amount_sen, method text check in ('cash','bank_transfer','online'), status text check in ('pending_verification','approved','rejected','voided'), received_at timestamptz not null, slip_path text null unique, gateway_bill_id uuid null unique, idempotency_key uuid null, cu
186:- Triggers (in `private`): audit_log blocks UPDATE/DELETE/TRUNCATE; payments blocks DELETE and allows UPDATE only of status/decided_by/decided_at/reason/unapplied_sen with transitions pending_verification→approved|rejected, approved→voided (D12); invoices/leases amount + date columns immutable after insert (no update path needed).
193:- `private.allocate_payment(p_payment_id uuid) returns void` — caller holds the lease lock; fills unpaid invoices ordered by `due_date, (kind = 'rent'), period_index nulls first`; leftover → payments.unapplied_sen.
198:- `private.create_gateway_bill(p_actor_id uuid, p_lease_id uuid, p_as_of timestamptz default now()) returns table(id uuid, amount_sen bigint)` — lock lease; P0404 unless actor is the lease's tenant (tenants.user_id); amount = Σ over invoices with due_date <= (p_as_of at time zone 'Asia/Kuala_Lumpur')::date of (amount − allocated); 0 → P0422 "Nothing is due"; insert pending bill; audit `
